{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55491","headline":"题棺木 二 · 朱贞白","name":"题棺木 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一夜小园开似雪。\n（《江湖小集》卷八绍嵩《江浙纪行集句诗》。\n）（按：朱贞白，《全唐诗》卷八七○作李贞白。\n《增修诗话总龟前集》卷二十引《谈苑》作李正白，「正」爲讳改。\n《类说》引作朱贞白。\n今从《宋朝事实类苑》列目。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}